      "trigger": "styling",
      "claimId": "FR4",
      "claim": "The caller's control MUST own a box. A component MUST NOT render it inside a wrapper with no box of its own (`display: contents`), and MUST NOT depend on such a wrapper where it paints or offsets a focus indicator on the trigger, or positions the overlay against the trigger's rect: there is no rect to anchor to and no box on which to paint. FR1 removes the need for any wrapper.",
