      "trigger": "styling",
      "claimId": "FR5",
      "claim": "Hover, pressed, and every other pointer paint on the caller's control MUST remain the caller's own CSS. The component MUST NOT write paint onto an element it does not render. The component MUST publish the overlay's open state on the handed-back props as `aria-expanded`, so a caller styles the open state from the rendered attribute and no additional public API is added for it.",
